1
00:00:00,538 --> 00:00:03,238
(Leonard:)I'm kidding,
I want you to feel at home here.

2
00:00:03,241 --> 00:00:05,411
(Leonard:)Decorate it any way
that makes you happy.

3
00:00:05,410 --> 00:00:06,910
(Penny:)Do you really mean that?

4
00:00:06,911 --> 00:00:07,881
(Leonard:)I really do.

5
00:00:07,879 --> 00:00:09,309
(Penny:)Great, and just so you know,

6
00:00:09,314 --> 00:00:10,914
(Penny:)I'm not getting rid
of all your stuff.

7
00:00:10,915 --> 00:00:12,245
(Leonard:)Yeah? What are you keeping?

8
00:00:12,250 --> 00:00:13,820
(Penny:)That candle

9
00:00:13,818 --> 00:00:15,288
(Howard:)and you.

10
00:00:16,955 --> 00:00:18,385
(Leonard:)What about my robot poster?

11
00:00:18,389 --> 00:00:19,359
Buh, buh, buh, buh, buh.

12
00:00:19,357 --> 00:00:21,427
(Penny:)I can make do
with just the candle.

13
00:00:28,032 --> 00:00:30,402
(Amy:)What's going on?

14
00:00:30,401 --> 00:00:33,571
(Sheldon:)I'm struggling with the thought
of leaving my old bedroom.

15
00:00:34,672 --> 00:00:37,272
(Amy:)Can it be more
of an internal struggle?

16
00:00:38,977 --> 00:00:40,247
(Sheldon:)I need to see it.

17
00:00:41,713 --> 00:00:43,243
(Sheldon:)While I'm gone,

18
00:00:43,248 --> 00:00:45,948
(Sheldon:)don't breathe on my pillow.

19
00:00:45,950 --> 00:00:47,880
(Amy:)How about if I just don't
breathe at all?

20
00:00:47,886 --> 00:00:49,916
(Sheldon:)That's my girl.

21
00:00:56,127 --> 00:01:12,027
(Sheldon:)What on earth?

